      "cooked": "<p>Hi Everyone,<br>\nWe’ve rolled out new updates to <strong>NextAI</strong>, the Frappe custom app that brings Google’s Gemini AI into ERPNext.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/5/75cb5f2d6fdf4ccd7b180b59301fad0d1d7190b4.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/75cb5f2d6fdf4ccd7b180b59301fad0d1d7190b4\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/5/75cb5f2d6fdf4ccd7b180b59301fad0d1d7190b4_2_496x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"gO3AkUToOVsyaUrRuRGYLur8R5W\" width=\"496\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/5/75cb5f2d6fdf4ccd7b180b59301fad0d1d7190b4_2_496x500.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/5/75cb5f2d6fdf4ccd7b180b59301fad0d1d7190b4_2_744x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/5/75cb5f2d6fdf4ccd7b180b59301fad0d1d7190b4.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F0F3F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">802×808 97.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-482057-whats-new-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-482057-whats-new-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/magnifying_glass_tilted_right.png?v=15\" title=\":magnifying_glass_tilted_right:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":magnifying_glass_tilted_right:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> What’s New</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Community Support</strong> – Join our <strong>WhatsApp</strong> and <strong>Telegram</strong> groups to get instant updates, share feedback, and connect with other users.</li>\n<li><strong>Daily Usage Report</strong> – Track how many AI hits are being used in your ERP.</li>\n<li><strong>Usage Log</strong> – View detailed logs of AI usage for better monitoring.</li>\n<li><strong>Usage Chart</strong> – Visualize daily AI usage directly inside ERPNext.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><a name=\"p-482057-free-ai-hits-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-482057-free-ai-hits-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Free AI Hits</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Get assured <strong>up to 1500 free AI hits per day</strong> with NextAI.</li>\n<li>We’re planning to improve this to <strong>10,000 free hits</strong>, so you can explore more without limits.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><a name=\"p-482057-recap-what-nextai-does-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-482057-recap-what-nextai-does-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Recap: What NextAI Does</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Generate ready-to-use content (policies, terms, T&amp;Cs)</li>\n<li>Correct grammar and improve clarity in real-time</li>\n<li>Enhance existing text with contextual AI prompts</li>\n<li>Works across multiple editor fields in ERPNext</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/backhand_index_pointing_right.png?v=15\" title=\":backhand_index_pointing_right:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":backhand_index_pointing_right:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Try it out: <a href=\"https://cloud.frappe.io/marketplace/apps/next_ai\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">NextAI on Marketplace</a><br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/backhand_index_pointing_right.png?v=15\" title=\":backhand_index_pointing_right:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":backhand_index_pointing_right:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Website: <a href=\"https://www.erpnextai.in/home\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"> ERPNextAI</a></p>\n<p>We’d love for you to try these new features, join the community, and share your feedback. Your input helps us shape NextAI into a more powerful companion for every ERPNext user.</p>",
